# target

Doubles every cell of a non-empty list.

```soil-sig
target : (xs : List F64) -> List F64
```

```requires
non-empty: len(xs) > 0
```

```ensures
length-kept: len(result) == len(xs)
```

```reference
ref/check.py::double_all
```

```test doubles
([1.0, 2.0]) => [2.0, 4.0]
([3.0]) => [6.0]
```
